1801
01:46:13,076 --> 01:46:15,745
[toy dinosaur] <i>Show me candy!</i>
<i>I'm gonna eat you all up.</i>

1802
01:46:18,414 --> 01:46:19,665
[distorted] <i>Show me candy!</i>

1803
01:46:21,292 --> 01:46:22,460
