[Kincaid] Oh, thank God.

1889
01:52:51,599 --> 01:52:52,659
[Teresa] Get us out of here!

1890
01:52:52,683 --> 01:52:54,727
Wait, wait, wait.
Just wait... Wait, wait, wait.

1891
01:52:56,896 --> 01:52:58,481
- Whoa, whoa!
- [panting] Did you...

1892
