Shut up!

1907
01:53:43,484 --> 01:53:45,170
[automated voice]
<i>Caution. Pedestrian ahead.</i>

1908
01:53:45,194 --> 01:53:46,194
[dinosaur grumbles]

1909
01:53:52,326 --> 01:53:53,786
[grunting]

1910
