- No, no, no.
- Bella! Bella, wait!

1937
01:55:30,674 --> 01:55:32,509
- Bella!
- Come back here! Come here!

1938
01:55:33,260 --> 01:55:34,613
[Loomis] Careful, Bella! Be careful!

1939
